{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-whitesnake_yure",
  "id": "source-35903",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35903001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "「最爱西湖二月天，斜风细雨送游船。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "是姐姐的声音！她就在前面！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇，好快，「嗖」的一下就消失了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这是什么魔法，有机会也教教我嘛~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "小青挂念着自己的姐姐，急于见到她才动用了瞬移身法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "果然如传说中一样，青白姐妹的感情真的很好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "姐姐，你可叫我好找，知不知道我很担心你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "嘘，青妹，你看这地方，可曾觉得眼熟？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "这个地方怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "烟波缥缈，水色温柔，像不像我们在江南见过的西湖？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "啊，是了，我知道姐姐为什么会来这里了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "这地方虽美，可远比不了西湖的秀丽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "姐姐，我们还是离开吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "且慢，我还答应了这位朋友，要为他唱曲儿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "听戏人",
          "text": "能听白娘子一曲，真是我的福分呐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "「相逢犹恨相识晚，西湖同舟非偶然。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "「千里姻缘一线牵，伞儿一护并头连。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "听戏人",
          "text": "余音绕梁，妙不可言，人间能得几回闻呐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "你、你好，我也很喜欢你的戏，可以请你给我签个名吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "不行！不可以！别靠近我姐姐！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "青妹，不可，我与你说过很多次——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白素贞",
          "text": "只要有人还愿意听，我的戏就会一直唱下去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35903023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "是，我知道，我会一直陪着你的，姐姐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
